Z||000007||862M4inCA||10-14-2000||06:26 AM||||I don't know who lied to you at the dealership about the parking brake cables, but there was a topic posted just a day or two ago about how they have changed the part numbers and the cables are STILL available. All three in fact. And I'm sure most of the other parts you need are still made, but listed under other numbers. I know someone who works with Triad, and supposedly they buy part numbers from GM, sort and resell them back to GM. He also mentioned that they "revise" old part numbers to reflect the new ones. If you can get the old numbers, I can see if I can get the new ones. ||||reg||1
